### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or copy into Postman / Thunder Client)
@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### login (krrish@demo.dev / User@123)
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"krrish@demo.dev","password":"User@123"}

### me
GET {{host}}/auth/me

### wallets
GET {{host}}/wallets

### portfolio
GET {{host}}/portfolio

### add a BUY (set walletId from /wallets)
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"walletId":3,"symbol":"BTC","txnType":"BUY","quantity":"0.01","pricePerUnit":"8700000","fees":"10","txnTime":"2026-10-14T10:00:00+05:30"}

### oversell -> 400
POST {{host}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"walletId":3,"symbol":"BTC","txnType":"SELL","quantity":"50","pricePerUnit":"8700000","txnTime":"2026-10-14T10:00:00+05:30"}

### filtered list
GET {{host}}/transactions?symbol=BTC&type=SELL

### generate tax report
POST {{host}}/tax-report
Content-Type: application/json

{"financialYear":"2026-27"}

### report detail
GET {{host}}/tax-report/2026-27

### asset search
GET {{host}}/assets?q=bit

### admin-only (login as admin first) -> 403 for normal users
POST {{host}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{"symbol":"DOGE","name":"Dogecoin"}
